WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.305
The free neural

00:00:01.117 --> 00:00:01.859
nets book is

00:00:01.671 --> 00:00:02.307
gone

00:00:02.838 --> 00:00:04.123
Michael Nielsen wrote

00:00:03.935 --> 00:00:05.243
Neural Networks and

00:00:05.079 --> 00:00:06.316
Deep Learning between

00:00:06.128 --> 00:00:07.472
twenty eleven and

00:00:07.307 --> 00:00:08.356
twenty fifteen

00:00:08.557 --> 00:00:09.512
when he expected

00:00:09.324 --> 00:00:10.668
neural-net AGI to

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:11.623
be many decades

00:00:11.435 --> 00:00:12.036
away

00:00:12.574 --> 00:00:13.529
His views have

00:00:13.341 --> 00:00:14.059
changed

00:00:14.178 --> 00:00:15.368
the systems raced

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:16.453
ahead far faster

00:00:16.265 --> 00:00:17.279
than he expected

00:00:17.468 --> 00:00:18.812
giving humanity too

00:00:18.624 --> 00:00:19.531
little time to

00:00:19.343 --> 00:00:20.616
meet the challenges

00:00:21.134 --> 00:00:22.065
He still sees

00:00:21.877 --> 00:00:23.280
genuine wonders coming

00:00:23.351 --> 00:00:24.152
but also a

00:00:23.964 --> 00:00:25.237
significant risk of

00:00:25.049 --> 00:00:26.393
catastrophe if the

00:00:26.205 --> 00:00:27.431
challenges are not

00:00:27.242 --> 00:00:27.796
met

00:00:28.326 --> 00:00:29.340
Full story on

00:00:29.151 --> 00:00:30.047
the dashboard
